Need cash in Japan? Convenience store ATMs are your friend 💴
Ask where, then pick English on the screen.

Today's phrases:
• ATMは どこですか (ee tii emu wa doko desu ka) = Where is the ATM?
• かいがい (kaigai) = Overseas
• えらべます (erabemasu) = You can choose

